obial habitat, it is a profound challenge for humans to accurately conceptualize the physical environment that soil microbes inhabit. With the goal of bringing the micro-scale experience of a soil microbe to life, Soil:Micro is an educational three-dimensional virtual reality (VR) soil environment experience.  Shrink to the scale of a particle and navigate through an actual 3D scan of a soil particle.", "short_description": "Due to the extraordinarily small scale of the soil microbial habitat, it is a profound challenge for humans to accurately conceptualize the physical environment that soil microbes inhabit. With the goal of bringing the micro-scale experience of a soil microbe to life, Soil:Micro is an educational three-dimensional virtual reality (VR) soil environment experience.  Shrink to the scale of a particle and navigate through an actual 3D scan of a soil particle."}]}, "developer_name": "Wisconsin Institute for Discovery Virtual Environments", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://virtualenvironments.discovery.wisc.edu/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Wisconsin Institute for Discovery", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://virtualenvironments.discovery.wisc.edu/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "37887634740835378"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": 